	(descr "Spring clamp (push-button) PCB terminal block, 3.5 mm pitch, staggered pins, 8 A. Holes in both pin rows for every pole, so both stagger phases fit: Ningbo Kangnex WJ250B-3.5-03P-11 (LCSC C8420, pole 1 in the front row) and MAX MX250-3.5-03P-B (LCSC C7470117, pole 1 in the back row); same body, wire entry on the -y face at 0 deg. Pads from LCSC/EasyEDA data and maker drawings, drill 1.2 mm.")
